OL,3,GNEWSAFood factory workers 'vote to
OL,4,Aaccept pay offer and end dispute'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFood factory workers who have been on
OL,7,Fstrike over pay since the start of
OL,8,FSeptember, have voted to accept an
OL,9,Fimproved pay deal and end their
OL,10,Fdispute, according to the Unite union.
OL,12,FWorkers at the Pilgrim's Europe food
OL,13,Fproduction plant in Enniskillen, County
OL,14,FFermanagh, wanted fairer pay and for
OL,15,Fstaff to be paid equally for breaks.
OL,17,FOn Friday, Unite said its members
OL,18,Femployed at the Enniskillen site "have
OL,19,Fvoted overwhelmingly to accept an
OL,20,Fimproved pay offer and end their
OL,21,Fdispute".
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
