OL,3,GNEWSAFood factory workers 'vote to
OL,4,Aaccept pay offer and end dispute'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt added that the deal "will see all
OL,7,Fshop floor workers receive a four per
OL,8,Fcent pay increase and will mean all
OL,9,Fworkers are fully paid for breaks".
